ithub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98294.patch","merged_at":"2024-10-21T21:48:14Z"},"body":"This reduces memory usage a bit in case multiple placeholders were requested, e.g. when using multiple NoiseTextures with no noise property defined. This addresses a longstanding TODO in the codebase.\r\n\r\nThe placeholder texture's appearance was also changed from a plain magenta color to a checkerboard alternating between magenta and black pixels. This makes it easier to spot when the placeholder texture ends up being used in a complex scene (very likely by accident). The texture's dimensions remain identical to keep the physical size identical in 2D.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nDecals and a FogVolume with a FogMaterial that uses an uninitialized NoiseTexture density map:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc3a6a94-01a3-459b-9c7b-87420792f4d2)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98294/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_u